mcpu-cpp: mcpu-cpp (MCPU languages preprocessor)
mcpu-cpp:
mcpu-cpp: mcpu-cpp is a source preprocessor for the MCPU toolchain.
mcpu-cpp: It provides C-style macros, conditional compilation, file inclusion,
mcpu-cpp: line control, and related preprocessing facilities.
mcpu-cpp: External text is UTF-8 while internal text processing uses UCS-2.
mcpu-cpp: It uses LibMPU and LibMPUIO; ZUBR is required only to regenerate
mcpu-cpp: the expression parser from its grammar sources.
